uutils grep is a cross-platform reimplementation of GNU grep in Rust.

This package installs the same file names as sysutils/ggrep:
${PREFIX}/bin/ggrep, plus ${PREFIX}/bin/gegrep and
${PREFIX}/bin/gfgrep wrappers that invoke it with -E and -F.  It
conflicts with sysutils/ggrep and declares it as a secondary pkgpath,
so the package tools accept it as a provider of that path.  The GNU
package must not be installed at the same time.
